doc:esaFormationNote a schema:CreativeWork ;
    rdfs:label "formation of ESA from ESRO and ELDO"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The Court observes that ESA was formed out of ESRO and ELDO as a new and single organisation (see paragraph 12 above)."@en .

